                "title": "St. Charles Lever with Victorian Rose, Fusion AN-C8",
                "description": "St. Charles Lever with Victorian Rose Fusion AN-C8 - The geometric shape of the Stint Charles Lever helps to contrast against the gentle scrolling of the Victorian Rose striking a perfect balance between hard and soft. Solid brass, this Fusion leverset is available in 5 finishes.  It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
